			<label>Zylon</label>
			<description>TIER 4 - High Tech
&gt;&gt;&gt; Optimal	Thermal Armor, Heat Resistance
&gt;&gt; Suitable	Ballistic Armor
X Inadvisable 	Durability

Recognized by its golden hue, Zylon is a high-perfomance synthetic fiber with fire-resistant properties. It makes top-tier ballistic armor, bested only by Dyneema, but as a textile, it's unrivaled against energy weapons. It also makes effective fire-fighting apparel, second only to Nomex. Its only real failing is the fibers tend to break down over time so it doesn't have the longevity other ballistic fibers have.</description>
